Local src/upstream/ files adapt AMD wrappers to ES modules. Three.js supplies
math types used by that simulation. Babylon.js renders the original scene.

Trigger Rally Content is not included or distributed. The car, scenery,
terrain samples, material textures, interface artwork and music in this
version are original project-generated replacements.
